{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20764","headline":"赠徐希仁石砚别 · 卢仝","name":"赠徐希仁石砚别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灵山一片不灵石，手斲成器心所惜。\n凤鸟不至池不成，蛟龙乾蟠水空滴。\n青松火链翠烟凝，寒竹风摇远天碧。\n今日赠君离别心，此中至浅造化深。\n用之可以过珪璧，弃置还爲一片石。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢仝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20764.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20764","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}